  m_text: "<size=72><b>STILL</b></size>\n<size=30><color=#8FE6FF>\uD574\uC591 \uAD00\uCE21\uC18C
    STILL \xB7 1,000m \uC758 \uC2E0\uD638</color></size>\n\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uB9CC\uB4E0
    \uC0AC\uB78C</color></size>\n<size=36><b>\uC624\uC815\uD6C8</b></size>\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uAD00\uCE21\uC18C\uC7A5\uC758
    \uBAA9\uC18C\uB9AC \xB7 \uC0DD\uBB3C \uC124\uBA85</color></size>\nGoogle Gemini\n(\uC77C\uC9C0\uC5D0
    \uC5C6\uB294 \uC0DD\uBB3C\uC740 \uACE0\uC815 \uB300\uBCF8)\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uBC14\uB2E4
    \uC0DD\uBB3C \xB7 \uC0B0\uD638 \uBAA8\uB378</color></size>\nLayer Lab \xB7 3D
    Characters - Fish (Unity Asset Store)\nPixit3D - Fish Free Pack \xB7 Pixit Games
    (Unity Asset Store)\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uBCF4\uB9AC \uC120\uC7A5 \xB7
    \uB180\uB780</color></size>\n\"Pirate Captain\" by Quaternius (Poly Pizza, CC0)\nStylized
    NPC - Peasant Nolant \xB7 Winged Boots Studio (Unity Asset Store)\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uC2EC\uD574
    \uC0DD\uBB3C \xB7 \uACE0\uB798</color></size>\n\"Angler Fish - Inktober Day 3\"
    by lesliestowe\n\"Vampire Squid\" \xB7 \"Gigantura Chuni\" \xB7 \"Hatchet Fish\"
    by Razan Negm\n\"Dumbo Octopus\" by Erik\n\"Pacific Viperfish\" by redsonder1000\n\"Sperm
    Whale\" \xB7 \"Humpback Whale\" \xB7 \"Blue Rorqual\" by nolanfa\n\"Whale Skeleton\"
    by 20lux \xB7 \"Oarfish\" by TheoBaldeteBRID\n<size=24>Sketchfab, CC BY 4.0 (modified:
    materials and scale)</size>\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uBC24\uC758 \uC774\uC57C\uAE30
    \xB7 2,500m \uC5F4\uC218\uAD6C</color></size>\n\"Sequoia Vent - Mariana Islands\"
    by DeepSeaBEE\n\"Riftia pachyptila\" by Scientart\n\"Crab_Walking\" by majidakbarimoganjogi\n<size=24>Sketchfab,
    CC BY 4.0 (modified: reduced polygons, materials, colors and scale)</size>\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uB85C\uBE44</color></size>\n\"Elevator
    - Low Poly Animated\" by JeffK, CC BY 4.0\n\"Animated Ticket Gate\" by \u20ACr!c,
    CC BY 4.0\n\"Bathysphere | New York Aquarium\" by sabster, CC BY 4.0\n<size=24>(modified:
    reduced polygons and texture size)</size>\nFurniture Kit \xB7 UI Pack \xB7 Watercraft
    Kit \xB7 Kenney (CC0)\n\uD558\uB298 \xB7 \uBAA8\uB798 \xB7 \uBC14\uC704 \xB7
    \uBD80\uD45C \xB7 Poly Haven (CC0)\n3D Free Modular Kit \xB7 Barking Dog (Unity
    Asset Store)\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uC18C\uB9AC</color></size>\n\"Exploration
    Theme\" \xB7 Cleyton Kauffman (CC0)\n\uBC14\uB2F7\uAC00 \uAC08\uB9E4\uAE30 \xB7
    selcukartut (Pixabay)\n\uBB3C\uC18D \uD558\uAC15 \xB7 DRAGON-STUDIO (Pixabay)\n\uBB3C\uC18C\uB9AC
    \xB7 \uBB3C\uBCF4\uB77C \xB7 \uC18C\uB098 \xB7 \uC885\uC18C\uB9AC \xB7 \uCF54\uB4DC\uB85C
    \uB9CC\uB4E0 \uC18C\uB9AC\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uAE00\uAF34 \xB7 \uC544\uC774\uCF58</color></size>\n\uB098\uB214\uC2A4\uD018\uC5B4\uB77C\uC6B4\uB4DC
    \xB7 NAVER (SIL OFL 1.1)\nMaterial Icons \xB7 Google (Apache 2.0)\n\n<size=26><color=#8FB0C0>\uBC14\uB2E4
    \uC22B\uC790</color></size>\n71% \xB7 80% \xB7 NOAA\n\n\n<size=40><b>\uC624\uB298
    \uBC24, \uAD00\uCE21\uD574 \uC918\uC11C \uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uC694.</b></size>"
